{"reviews":[{"id":"B07FVM1VQ1-0","r":5.0,"t":"Well built nail clippers","x":"These nail clippers are built very well. It is easy to cut off tough, hard toenails as these are not only sharp, but also very sturdy. The grips are easy to hold and the two levels can make sure that the clippers spring back. I highly recommend them.","h":2,"v":1,"d":"Jun 2019"},{"id":"B07FVM1VQ1-1","r":1.0,"t":"damgerous design","x":"I'm a professional foot care RN and this design is one of the most dangerous I've come across. The tip curves down more than most and it is darn near impossible to avoid nipping a patient--this is especially bad with diabetics.","h":2,"v":1,"d":"Mar 2019"},{"id":"B07FVM1VQ1-2","r":5.0,"t":"Very sharp and effective!","x":"They are very sharp therefore very effective! Cut my thick toenails like never before and so easy with the curved tip. Fit perfectly with the curve of the nails. Would buy again 100%. Thank you!","h":2,"v":1,"d":"Feb 2019"},{"id":"B07FVM1VQ1-3","r":5.0,"t":"Heavy duty nail clippers","x":"Don't let the low price fool you into thinking it is a cheap product.  Quite the contrary....very sturdy and very well made.  Cuts those thick toenails very easily.  Greatest ones I have found.","h":1,"v":1,"d":"May 2019"},{"id":"B07FVM1VQ1-4","r":5.0,"t":"Great handles!","x":"Easy to use, I have thick toe nails other clippers hurt my hands on the hard handle, the big rubber handles on these are great! My hands Don't hurt.","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Feb 2019"},{"id":"B07FVM1VQ1-5","r":3.0,"t":"no directions and poor packaging","x":"when unwrapped the 2 central spring bars fell off t he clippers and there are no directions on the packaging as to how to reinsert them","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Aug 2018"},{"id":"B07FVM1VQ1-6","r":5.0,"t":"Great toe nail clippers","x":"Wow!  Great toe nail clippers.  Amazed how easily these clippers cut thru hard and thick nails.","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Feb 2019"},{"id":"B07FVM1VQ1-7","r":2.0,"t":"Sharpness","x":"They are very sharp, but one spring popped out of handle the first time I used them","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Apr 2019"},{"id":"B07FVM1VQ1-8","r":5.0,"t":"Worked surprisingly well","x":"Worked great for thick nails and ingrown toenails. Easy grip for small hands","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Apr 2019"},{"id":"B07FVM1VQ1-9","r":1.0,"t":"I would note give it ant stars","x":"Don\u2019t waste your money! Didn\u2019t cut my tonsils at all. Very dull.","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Nov 2018"},{"id":"B07FVM1VQ1-10","r":5.0,"t":"Does what they say it does","x":"Works well. Good grips.  Nice curve on the cutting blade","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Aug 2018"},{"id":"B07FVM1VQ1-11","r":5.0,"t":"These are very sturdy .","x":"These clippers are more than capable of doing the job, As a safety precaution, I had to take the sharp pointed tips to a sharpening stone just to dull them and round them off a little bit. They were so sharp that if you weren't very careful you could easily slip and poke yourself bad enough to start bleeding. Other than being so sharp that you could possibly injure yourself, These clippers are very sturdy and are better than any I have ever really used.","h":0,"v":1,"d":"May 2019"},{"id":"B07FVM1VQ1-12","r":4.0,"t":"Just what I needed for helping grandma!","x":"I needed a decent pair of clippers to help keep my diabetic grandma\u2019s nails trimmed.  I used to bring her to a podiatrist for it, but it\u2019s kind of an ordeal.  Now I check her feet and trim her nails if needed after I help her shower.  They are thicker and oddly shaped from years of high heeled pointy shoes. It was difficult to get regular clippers to trim the right parts.  These work great without much work, but beware, they are very sharp and pointy!","h":0,"v":0,"d":"Dec 2018"},{"id":"B07FVM1VQ1-13","r":5.0,"t":"Works very well","x":"The highest quality, very sharp, and well designed.  I have a fused back, and when cutting my nails I can not bend over and reach my toes so my wife has to do it for me.  I wish they made a pair like these only with about a 6\u201d longer handle.  I would gladly pay $50.00 for a pair like this.  Arthur Decker, Bristol, CT","h":0,"v":1,"d":"Jul 2019"},{"id":"B07FVM1VQ1-14","r":1.0,"t":"Poor design of springs","x":"These are hefty clippers that are sharp cutters. The weakness is the hinged springs keep slipping out of their holes making them useless. I am trying to super glue or otherwise fix this annoying problem rather than mess with a return. So far no success. Not recommended because of this major manufacturing flaw.","h":0,"v":1,"d":"May 2019"},{"id":"B07FVM1VQ1-15","r":5.0,"t":"Large but pretty effective","x":"I thought they were too large to get into the areas I needed. I then realized I was holding them upside down. They are very sharp and sturdy. No problems taking out some torn cuticles.  They are definitely large. Something to be kept in the cabinet at home.","h":0,"v":1,"d":"Nov 2018"},{"id":"B07FVM1VQ1-16","r":5.0,"t":"Worth it!","x":"I bought this one to help my boyfriend with his toe nails. They are ingrown, and it's hard to manicure. Is is a little bulky, so I need to use another tool if I need to manicure deeper in his nail. However, I feel that it's sturdy and durable. Love it!","h":0,"v":1,"d":"Oct 2018"},{"id":"B07FVM1VQ1-17","r":5.0,"t":"Excellent toe nail clipper","x":"If you have thicker nails, this is the toe clipper for you.  I only need it for a couple nails, but it works wonderful.  One word of caution - this product has VERY sharp points.  Keep away from children and be careful when using.","h":0,"v":1,"d":"Apr 2019"},{"id":"B07FVM1VQ1-18","r":5.0,"t":"Great toenail clippers!","x":"I'm so glad I got these clippers.  They're very easy to use, and cut perfectly.  To me, the best part is the large grips/handles - they make it SO much easier to hold while cutting.  I'd definitely buy them again.","h":0,"v":1,"d":"Jun 2019"},{"id":"B07FVM1VQ1-19","r":5.0,"t":"Effective clippers","x":"These worked really well, they are really sharp and very effective.  It took me a bit to figure out that one of the metal pieces towards the base of the handles needs to be pushed up then they spring back open.","h":0,"v":1,"d":"Feb 2019"},{"id":"B07FVM1VQ1-20","r":5.0,"t":"More value for your money","x":"It's a nice quality clipper that does a good job clipping your toenails. Caution should always be taken when using toenail clippers, because they do have a sharp pointed edge.","h":0,"v":1,"d":"Apr 2019"},{"id":"B07FVM1VQ1-21","r":5.0,"t":"Love them","x":"I have  tough old toe nails and my wife does me the honors as I can\u2019t easily get down to cut them These babies are sharp and can cut through my worst nails fairly easily.","h":0,"v":1,"d":"Jun 2019"},{"id":"B07FVM1VQ1-22","r":5.0,"t":"Best Toe Nail Clippers","x":"These things will go throught the toughest and thickest of nails, these things are a life saver when it come to clipping nails. I always replace them with this brand!","h":0,"v":1,"d":"Dec 2020"},{"id":"B07FVM1VQ1-23","r":5.0,"t":"wow they are sharp","x":"needed to replace my old clippers. I looked around,  figure these look easy to hold for an old guy like me. They were and sharp too. Be careful","h":0,"v":1,"d":"Mar 2019"},{"id":"B07FVM1VQ1-24","r":3.0,"t":"Not Very Well Pleased","x":"The angle you have to hold this at I don't know anyone is supposed to use it. It got a strange cutting angel. I wouldn't buy another one.","h":0,"v":1,"d":"May 2019"}],"emb":"","summary":{"claims":[{"text":"Many reviewers find the clippers very sharp and effective at cutting thick, hard toenails.","cites":[1,3,4,7,9,11,14]},{"text":"Reviewers frequently praise the sturdy, well-built construction and easy-to-hold grips.","cites":[1,4,5,9,11,12]},{"text":"A recurring complaint is that the spring bars pop out or slip from their holes, making the clippers unusable.","cites":[6,8,15]},{"text":"Some reviewers warn the tips are dangerously sharp or the curved design risks nipping skin.","cites":[2,12]},{"text":"A few reviewers report the clippers being dull or not cutting at all.","cites":[10]}]},"qa":[]}